<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: directional shield generator -->
  <DNX_DirectionalShieldGenerator.label>定向护盾发生器</DNX_DirectionalShieldGenerator.label>
  <!-- EN: An experimental one-way defensive shield generator. It projects a short forward shield wall that absorbs incoming non-overhead projectiles until its shield charge collapses. -->
  <DNX_DirectionalShieldGenerator.description>一种实验性单向防御护盾发生器。它会向前投射一段短程护盾墙，吸收来袭的非越顶射弹，直到护盾充能崩溃。</DNX_DirectionalShieldGenerator.description>
  
  <!-- EN: EDD -->
  <DNX_EDD.label>EDD</DNX_EDD.label>
  <!-- EN: EDD mounted, let them come. -->
  <DNX_EDD.description>EDD装好了，让他们来吧。</DNX_EDD.description>
  
  <!-- EN: maintenance arm -->
  <DNX_MaintenanceArm.label>维护臂</DNX_MaintenanceArm.label>
  <!-- EN: An automated maintenance arm that scans nearby friendly buildings, extends a repair manipulator, restores damaged structures over time, and sprays firefoam at flames within its maintenance range. -->
  <DNX_MaintenanceArm.description>一种自动维护臂，会扫描附近友方建筑，伸出维修机械臂持续修复受损结构，并向维护范围内的火焰喷射灭火泡沫。</DNX_MaintenanceArm.description>
  
  <!-- EN: sonic shock emitter -->
  <DNX_SonicShockEmitter.label>音波冲震仪</DNX_SonicShockEmitter.label>
  <!-- EN: An experimental defensive device. When manually activated, it releases a spreading shock pulse that briefly stuns creatures in range, then forces itself into breakdown until repaired. -->
  <DNX_SonicShockEmitter.description>一种实验性防御装置。手动激活时，它会释放扩散的冲击脉冲，短暂击晕范围内的生物，随后进入故障状态，直到被修复。</DNX_SonicShockEmitter.description>
  <!-- EN: Release a sonic shock pulse with radius 6, stunning pawns in range for 5 seconds. The device breaks down after activation and must be repaired before reuse. -->
  <DNX_SonicShockEmitter.comps.CompSonicShockEmitter.commandDesc>释放半径6格的声波冲击脉冲，使范围内单位眩晕5秒。装置激活后会故障，必须修复后才能再次使用。</DNX_SonicShockEmitter.comps.CompSonicShockEmitter.commandDesc>
  <!-- EN: Activate shock pulse -->
  <DNX_SonicShockEmitter.comps.CompSonicShockEmitter.commandLabel>激活冲击脉冲</DNX_SonicShockEmitter.comps.CompSonicShockEmitter.commandLabel>
  
  <!-- EN: tactical nuclear missile silo -->
  <DNX_TacticalNuclearMissileSilo.label>战术核导弹发射井</DNX_TacticalNuclearMissileSilo.label>
  <!-- EN: A strategic defensive network weapon platform capable of launching a tactical nuclear missile at any point on the current map. -->
  <DNX_TacticalNuclearMissileSilo.description>能够在当前地图上的任意地点发射战术核导弹的战略防御网络武器平台。</DNX_TacticalNuclearMissileSilo.description>
  
</LanguageData>
